       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SIMPLE-INTEREST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PRINCIPAL    PIC 9(10)V99.
       01 WS-RATE         PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 WS-INTEREST     PIC 9(10)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 10000 TO WS-PRINCIPAL.
           MOVE 5 TO WS-RATE.
           COMPUTE WS-INTEREST = WS-PRINCIPAL * WS-RATE / 100.
           DISPLAY "Interest: " WS-INTEREST.
           STOP RUN.
